{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，公伐邾婁。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"二、三月甲戌，取須朐。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"取邑不日，此何以日？內辭也，使若他人然。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"三、遂城郚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"四、夏四月，宋公王臣卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"五、宋人殺其大夫。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"何以不名？宋三世無大夫，三世內娶也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"六、戊子，晉人及秦人戰于令狐，晉先眛以師奔秦。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"此偏戰也，何以不言師敗績？敵也。此晉先眛也，其稱人何？貶。曷為貶？外也。其外奈何？以師外也。何以不言出？遂在外也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"七、狄侵我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"八、秋八月，公會諸侯、晉大夫盟于扈。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"諸侯何以不序？大夫何以不名？公失序也。公失序奈何？諸侯不可使與公盟，眣晉大夫使與公盟也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"九、冬，徐伐莒。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_103_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_103","textTraditional":"十、公孫敖如莒莅盟。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}